        "description": "Normal length of the distal phalanges and thumbs",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of symmetrical shortening or absence of middle phalanges in digits 2-5 confirmed radiographically plus a positive family history consistent with autosomal dominant inheritance",
